Rules for python development:
* A function should have no more than one try/except block. DO NOT nest try/except blocks unless specified
* Use strict type hinting in python
* Use python 3.13, so no need to import List, Dict or Option, use the built in type annotation for those instead.
* Prioritize using Pydantic models for modelling data instead of dicts of type dict[str, Any] if possible